  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - Coordination Ukraine facility, Bryssel short term</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - Givarkoordinering Ukraina facility, Bryssel korttid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser sekundering av en nationell expert till Ukraine Donor CorPlatform, med placering i Bryssel. Tj&#xe4;nsten &#xe4;r placerad vid sekritariatet f&#xf6;r Multi-agency Donor Coordination for Ukraine som i sin tur &#xe4;r placerad vid DG ENEST, direktoratet f&#xf6;r Enlargement and Eastern Neighbourhood. Sekretariatet tillhandah&#xe5;ller administrativt st&#xf6;d och koordinering genom Plattformen i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med regeringsf&#xf6;retr&#xe4;dare f&#xf6;r Ukraina, G7 l&#xe4;nderna och Kommissionen.
F&#xf6;rordnandet &#xe4;r kort-tids vikariat p&#xe5; sex m&#xe5;nader p&#xe5; grund av ordinarie sekunderads f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ldraledighet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment concerns the secondment of a national expert to the Ukraine Donor CorPlatform, based in Brussels. The position is located at the secretariat for Multi-agency Donor Coordination for Ukraine, which in turn is part of DG ENEST, the directorate for Enlargement and Eastern Neighbourhood. The secretariat provides administrative support and coordination through the Platform in close cooperation with government representatives for Ukraine, the G7 countries, and the Commission. 
The appointment is a short-term temporary position for six months due to the regular secondee being on parental leave.</narrative>
  </description>
